<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal's 1997 budget plan available on Internet.</title>
<headline>Portugal's 1997 budget plan available on Internet.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Portugal's 1997 budget plan is available on the Internet in Portuguese.</p>
<p>The address is http://www.infocid.pt/orcamento/.</p>
<p>--Lisbon bureau 3511-3150035</p>
</text>
